The data-layer umbrella orchestrates five submodules, each governed by
its own LICENSE. The umbrella BSD-3-Clause applies to the orchestration
code in this repository (bootstrap, install.sh, docker-compose.yml,
docker-entrypoint.sh, HANDOFF.md, docs/, scripts/, tests/, .a0proj/, .env.example,
.gitmodules, .gitignore, AGENTS.md, README.md).

Submodule license summary:
- data-layer-postgres: PostgreSQL License (BSD-style)
- data-layer-redis:    BSD-3-Clause (operates against Valkey 8.x, BSD-3)
- data-layer-falkordb: SSPL v1 (per upstream FalkorDB; non-OSI — see its LICENSE)
- data-layer-qdrant:   Apache License 2.0 (per upstream Qdrant)
- data-layer-adapters:  BSD-3-Clause (Casey, 2026)